      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 8GB R2V",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## HodikiX 8GB R2V (do not Queue with WAI/Krea or T2V)\n\n- Template clone of video_minimax_h3_r2v.json\n- UnetLoaderGGUF: MiniMax-H3-REF2VA-Q3_K_M.gguf\n- CLIPLoaderGGUF type=minimax device=cpu: qwen3vl-32B-MiniMax-H3-Q2_K.gguf\n- Resolution 0.2 MP 9:16 = 352x608; duration 0.2s -> length 5; turbo 4-step ON\n- LoadImage: S01.png (Vf1 front full-body). Prompt must include <Picture 1>.\n- No ref video / ref audio this round.\n- POST /free before Queue. Do not Queue the official INT8+NVFP4 template.\n"
      ],
